Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: recover L2S idle with owned supplies and incoming mode

Recover using the incoming mode and cached effective brightness. Track
regulator references independently of preparation, so failed recovery and
repeated teardown remain balanced. Retain the first runtime failure.

Wake deferred backlight requests using the old CRTC state: duplication has
already cleared SR in the new state. Run the commit outside update_lock to
avoid inversion against KMS backlight callbacks, and drain work on removal.

